{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "ecosystem",
  "category": "",
  "title": "Ecosistema JS",
  "storageKey": "docs-ecosystem",
  "hasBehavior": true,
  "styles": [
    ".eco-lede { max-width: 46rem; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--iswc-text-soft); }",
    "    .eco-steps { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; padding-left: 1.25rem; color: var(--iswc-text-soft); }",
    "    .eco-steps li { margin: 0.35rem 0; }",
    "    .eco-grid {",
    "      display: grid;",
    "      gap: 1rem;",
    "      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 16rem), 1fr));",
    "      margin: 0 0 1.25rem;",
    "    }",
    "    .eco-pick {",
    "      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.45rem;",
    "      padding: 0.75rem 0.85rem;",
    "      border: 1px solid var(--iswc-border);",
    "      border-radius: var(--iswc-radius, 0.5em);",
    "      background: var(--iswc-bg-elev);",
    "      max-height: 16rem; overflow: auto;",
    "    }",
    "    .eco-pick label {",
    "      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem;",
    "      font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--iswc-text);",
    "      cursor: pointer;",
    "    }",
    "    .eco-pick code { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--iswc-text-dim); }",
    "    .eco-bytes {",
    "      margin: 0 0 0.75rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--iswc-text-soft);",
    "    }",
    "    .eco-bytes strong { color: var(--iswc-text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }",
    "    .eco-snippet-wrap { margin: 0 0 1rem; }",
    "    .eco-live {",
    "      display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center;",
    "      padding: 0.85rem; border: 1px dashed var(--iswc-border);",
    "      border-radius: var(--iswc-radius, 0.5em); background: var(--iswc-bg-soft);",
    "      min-height: 3.2rem;",
    "    }",
    "    .eco-toolbar {",
    "      display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem 1rem;",
    "      align-items: end; margin: 0 0 1rem;",
    "    }",
    "    .eco-field {",
    "      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.3rem;",
    "      font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--iswc-text-soft);",
    "      min-width: min(100%, 16rem); flex: 1 1 14rem;",
    "    }",
    "    .eco-field input {",
    "      font: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--iswc-text);",
    "      background: var(--iswc-bg); border: 1px solid var(--iswc-border);",
    "      border-radius: var(--iswc-radius-sm, 0.35em); padding: 0.4rem 0.55rem;",
    "    }",
    "    .eco-count { margin: 0 0 0.75rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--iswc-text-dim); }",
    "    .eco-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.65rem; }",
    "    .eco-card {",
    "      padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem; border: 1px solid var(--iswc-border);",
    "      border-radius: var(--iswc-radius, 0.5em); background: var(--iswc-bg-elev);",
    "    }",
    "    .eco-card__head {",
    "      display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline;",
    "      gap: 0.35rem 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;",
    "    }",
    "    .eco-card__id { margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 650; color: var(--iswc-text); }",
    "    .eco-card__path {",
    "      font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;",
    "      font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--iswc-text-dim); word-break: break-all;",
    "    }",
    "    .eco-card__sum {",
    "      margin: 0 0 0.45rem; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--iswc-text-soft); line-height: 1.4;",
    "    }",
    "    .eco-exports {",
    "      display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.3rem;",
    "      margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none;",
    "    }",
    "    .eco-exports code {",
    "      font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem; border-radius: 0.25em;",
    "      background: var(--iswc-code-bg, var(--iswc-bg-soft)); color: var(--iswc-code-text, var(--iswc-text));",
    "    }",
    "    .eco-meta { margin: 0.45rem 0 0; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--iswc-text-dim); }"
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Get started",
      "role": "region",
      "ariaLabel": "Get started del loader JS",
      "lede": "Un solo entry liviano (<code>loader.min.js</code>) carga CSS de documento y solo los módulos que pedís. Evitá <code>all.min.js</code> (~1.8&nbsp;MB resuelto) salvo demos locales.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p class=\"eco-lede\">Flujo recomendado para cualquier HTML de producto:</p>",
            "          <ol class=\"eco-steps\">",
            "            <li>Importá <code>ISWebComponentsLoader</code> desde el CDN (mismo pin/ref que el resto del kit).</li>",
            "            <li>Llamá <code>loadPageStyles(['iswc-palettes-default'])</code> (temas + marca; <code>is-base</code> se auto-inyecta).</li>",
            "            <li>Llamá <code>load(...)</code> con tags (<code>iswc-button</code>) o categorías (<code>actions</code>, <code>data-viz</code>; alias <code>charts</code> → <code>data-viz</code>).</li>",
            "            <li>El CSS de cada componente lo trae su propio <code>.min.js</code> vía <code>adoptCss</code> en el shadow — no hace falta listarlo a mano.</li>",
            "          </ol>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"eco-snippet-wrap\">",
            "            <iswc-code id=\"ecoGetStarted\" lang=\"html\" readonly compact></iswc-code>",
            "          </div>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "playground",
      "title": "Playground del loader",
      "role": "region",
      "ariaLabel": "Playground interactivo del loader de ISWC",
      "lede": "Elegí categorías o tags y copiá el snippet. El live demo aplica <code>load()</code> sobre esta misma página.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"eco-grid\">",
            "            <div>",
            "              <p class=\"eco-count\">Categorías</p>",
            "              <div class=\"eco-pick\" id=\"ecoCats\"></div>",
            "            </div>",
            "            <div>",
            "              <p class=\"eco-count\">Tags (acciones rápidas)</p>",
            "              <div class=\"eco-pick\" id=\"ecoTags\"></div>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </div>",
            "          <div class=\"eco-snippet-wrap\">",
            "            <iswc-code id=\"ecoSnippet\" lang=\"html\" readonly compact></iswc-code>",
            "          </div>",
            "          <div class=\"eco-live\" id=\"ecoLive\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>",
            "          <iswc-button id=\"ecoApply\" color=\"brand\">Aplicar load()</iswc-button>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "shared",
      "title": "Módulos _shared",
      "role": "region",
      "ariaLabel": "Catálogo de módulos compartidos en src/components/_shared",
      "lede": "Utilidades compartidas en <code>src/components/_shared/</code>: no son Web Components, pero sostienen el kit (eventos, CSS adoption, CDN, fechas, grids, diagramas…). Listado completo.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"eco-toolbar\">",
            "            <label class=\"eco-field\">Buscar",
            "              <input id=\"ecoFilter\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"nombre, path, export…\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-describedby=\"ecoCount\" />",
            "            </label>",
            "          </div>",
            "          <p class=\"eco-count\" id=\"ecoCount\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>",
            "          <div class=\"eco-list\" id=\"ecoList\" aria-busy=\"false\"></div>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
